WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.595
"We're here," Dipper said.

2
00:00:17.596 --> 00:00:24.606
"Tire Town Old Cars' Home."

3
00:00:24.607 --> 00:00:27.046
It was Saturday.

4
00:00:27.047 --> 00:00:31.370
The friends were meeting Dipper's grandma.

5
00:00:31.371 --> 00:00:39.403
"This place is nice," Eddy said.

6
00:00:39.404 --> 00:00:43.783
"I see a garden," Poppy said.

7
00:00:43.784 --> 00:00:48.171
Jeb looked around.

8
00:00:48.172 --> 00:00:51.723
"Does this place have dirt?" he asked.

9
00:00:51.723 --> 00:00:55.320
"Nope," Dipper said.

10
00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:58.136
"Older cars don't like dirt."

11
00:00:58.144 --> 00:01:01.912
"I don't see any piles," said Gasser.

12
00:01:01.913 --> 00:01:07.330
"There's nothing to jump over."

13
00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:10.707
"Of course not," Dipper said.

14
00:01:10.708 --> 00:01:14.743
"Older cars don't jump over piles."

15
00:01:14.744 --> 00:01:18.994
Some cars and trucks drove over.

16
00:01:18.994 --> 00:01:23.348
"Dipper!" said an ice cream truck.

17
00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:26.376
"Hi, Grandma!" Dipper said.

18
00:01:26.377 --> 00:01:29.707
"These are my friends."

19
00:01:29.708 --> 00:01:41.039
The older cars smiled at Eddy.

20
00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:44.309
They smiled at Poppy and Jeb.

21
00:01:44.310 --> 00:01:50.295
But then the cars saw Gasser.

22
00:01:50.295 --> 00:01:55.821
"Oh no!" one car said.

23
00:01:55.821 --> 00:02:00.587
"That truck is scary!"

